<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Imperial Bancorp started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Imperial Bancorp started.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth analyst Mark Morgan said  he started coverage of Imperial Bancorp with a neutral rating.</p>
<p>Shares in the company closed Friday off 1/2 at 30-3/8.</p>
<p>The company is a &quot;small commercial bank player in the Southern California  market with $4.2 billion in assets. Niches include significant market  positions in film financing, the garment industry and high-tech start-up  financing,&quot; Morgan said in a research alert.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
